SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ Kristikka
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, July 10th\nEvening Dan
 ce Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nFaci
 litator \\| DJ Kristikka\n\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout DJ Kristikka\n\nKristi
 kka loves creating a sacred container that takes you on an inward journey 
 utilizing rhythm to move us from quiet embodiment to chaos and down into s
 tillness and integration. She feels that movement is medicine\, weaving in
 tention and a rich blend of world beats where it’s possible to be with w
 hat is and open to what wants to be seen\, felt and moved. You can find he
 r dance mixes here:[ ](http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka) [http://soundcl
 oud.com/dj-kristikka](http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n
 \\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promp
 tly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please b
 e on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $1
 5 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-
 registration Recommended:\n\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org](htt
 ps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0
 CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAA
 R60jGoPctQmZENEP-6g1PiLerpr4LJLC5heP1Rn7TgedmIne3f6mes9kn3Wnw_aem_ASPUspeN
 ro8PjxFCFjEUGg)\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance f
 or free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.o
 rg/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=I
 wZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3O
 DgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_
 aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close
  at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENI
 NG CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovemen
 tcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-da
 nce/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lk
 EDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3E
 LhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement
  Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to 
 be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim a
