SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ Ted Riskin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, July 12th\n\n1st Dance
  Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance W
 ave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilitato
 r Ted Riskin\n\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout the Facilitator\nTed is interested
  in anything that can get him out of his head\, and music and movement do 
 a pretty good job of that. He hopes to offer music that facilitates an inn
 er journey and invitations that create a shift. While he likes modern elec
 tronic music\, he can’t create a mix without including lots of natural i
 nstruments and voices. Due to a short attention span\, he mixes in lots of
  different musical genres. You can hear some of his mixes on mixcloud.com/
 tarisk.\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm u
 p. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and people who arrive late w
 ill be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure containe
 r. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name your price.\nNo one turned away 
 for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNT
 EER!\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunt
 eer at: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashev
 illemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF
 6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFES
 CItA4rMD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\
 n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the openi
 ng circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nColle
 ctive agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](ht
 tps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAA
 YnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSy
 B7238bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnW
 xIQYKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world 
 that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves with
 in a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and
  healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for pers
 onal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organizati
 on.\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
